{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "021jun_401_2_4_021_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6dfafc46533fd6dd1aecc21b7a86538f570c45f8c9cf142051118d194723e231",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:021jun_401_2_4_021_01_09_a:2_4_021_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecfe775ca61449b18616e09d98278a328669ca2fefaf6bbb534b35e30ecb79b2",
      "text": "喂，制作人。\n打扰您离开座位的时间真是不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_401_2_4_021_01_09_a:2_4_021_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9e05b658bc731f122c615e5e79f33dddafa0012e41ba26359d8e8d4c57179e3",
      "text": "事务所屋顶的钥匙，我已经归还给\n贤先生了。今天我差不多该回去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_401_2_4_021_01_09_a:2_4_021_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59ea8b02560f6ba48a6239fdd583df315fd12a441412b68b164def92ae58ee75",
      "text": "请稍等一下，春名先生好像\n有话要我转告制作人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_401_2_4_021_01_09_a:2_4_021_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f72bed1d96cc00ef442ddf78528743eed33b7984d39c6991ac5d50b033b2c448",
      "text": "他说“帮我转告一声，旬的底子相当不错”。\n我已经转达了哦，春名先生。这样可以了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_401_2_4_021_01_09_a:2_4_021_01_09_a:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:444163882c38bfab3f4274d2053bb569c6ab4f552df1f4e393383e9693f04f72",
      "text": "练习辛苦了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_401_2_4_021_01_09_a:2_4_021_01_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13062915b6bee741bdc367843716b8ee148f8a98330d314eddf601fb0144cae8",
      "text": "这话您应该对春名先生说才对。明明不是他自己的\n工作，他却特意陪着我练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_401_2_4_021_01_09_a:2_4_021_01_09_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d1f8852a67e9ba299bd4f3c9bdac02b80b7af1fdd4845ae46664de5b19d39e3",
      "text": "很有春名先生的风格呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_401_2_4_021_01_09_a:2_4_021_01_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:943c15c2db3b7eeaca702d097a85fb2713d3964766670c87d0e1a1e6a8f103c1",
      "text": "旬先生也会做\n同样的事吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_401_2_4_021_01_09_a:2_4_021_01_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9461aa1967c077457c3114c116adbbcae0ae775d91cba2b25723aaea12f5e1a2",
      "text": "既然都得到了大家这么多的帮助，\n我一定会让它成功的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_401_2_4_021_01_09_a:2_4_021_01_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53b8dea03a0bc19f3c2aab2758696319288adae0f80878567d3d4d4600734493",
      "text": "我吗？……哎，说得也是。要是我处在相同的\n立场，我想我肯定也会做出同样的事吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_401_2_4_021_01_09_a:2_4_021_01_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2fbf85c69a92cdf69ab94b4cdb2f0739056038aab0cb5d8c248b99e80b9122c",
      "text": "明天也请继续让我使用屋顶。\n那么，我先失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
